///     - `value_at(row: usize, level: usize) -> &ColumnValue`: value in the index for given row and level
/// - `table.height() -> usize`: number of rows
/// - `table.insert_column_at_front(name: String, values: Vec<ColumnValue>) -> Result<(), Error>`: inserts a column
