   - When a complete subset is formed (reaching the desired size), it calculates the product of all elements
   - Adds the product to the running sum
   - Backtracks by removing the last element to explore other combinations

3. **Time Complexity**: O(C(n, k) × k) where C(n, k) is the binomial coefficient
