            "Mismatched lengths: {} values vs {} weights",
            col_values.len(),
            col_weights.len()
        ));
    }

    // Check that all weights are non-negative
    if col_weights.iter().any(|&w| w < 0.0) {
        return Err("Weights must be non-negative".to_string());
    }

    // Check that sum of weights is not zero
    let weight_sum: f64 = col_weights.iter().sum();
    if weight_sum == 0.0 {
        return Err("Sum of weights cannot be zero".to_string());
    }

    // Create a WeightedAverage and add all value-weight pairs
    let mut weighted_avg = WeightedAverage::new();

    for (&value, &weight) in col_values.iter().zip(col_weights.iter()) {
        weighted_avg.add(value, weight);
    }

    // Return the mean
    Ok(weighted_avg.mean())
}

