/// Replaces missing values in col0 with corresponding values from col1
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `data` - A 2D array representing the tabular dataset
/// * `col0` - Index of the column containing missing values to be filled
/// * `col1` - Index of the column providing values to fill the missing entries
///
