/// # Arguments
/// * `df0` - The input DataFrame to be grouped
/// * `group_column` - The name of the column to group by (default: "var0")
///
/// # Returns
/// A `HashMap` where keys are the distinct values from the group column and values are the
/// corresponding DataFrame subsets
///
/// # Example
/// ```
